{"id":9186,"date":"2021-11-22T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2021-11-22T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/unlocking-the-vb-mapp-expert-tips-insights-video\/"},"modified":"2024-10-03T17:05:09","modified_gmt":"2024-10-03T21:05:09","slug":"unlocking-the-vb-mapp-expert-tips-insights-video","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/unlocking-the-vb-mapp-expert-tips-insights-video\/","title":{"rendered":"Unlocking The VB-MAPP: Expert Tips &#038; Insights"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9186\" class=\"elementor elementor-9186\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6644c2e1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6644c2e1\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a361609\" data-id=\"a361609\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2dd3aeb7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2dd3aeb7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"videoDivHolder\"> <div> <video controls poster=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/485-MTE4ODkzOA_2022-rethink-vb-mapp-webinar_thumbnail.jpg\"> <source src=\"https:\/\/rtaprodmarketing.blob.core.windows.net\/rta-prod-marketingvideos\/485-MTE4ODkzOA_2022-rethink-vb-mapp-webinar.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\"> <\/video> <\/div> <\/div> <style> #videoDivHolder { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; } #videoDivHolder > div { position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; padding-top: 56.25%; } #videoDivHolder > div video { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; } <\/style>\n<h2>About This Webinar<\/h2>\nTypically the primary focus of an intervention program for children with autism should be on the development of effective language and social skills. There clearly are several other areas in need, such as&#8230;\n<ul>\n \t<li>self-care<\/li>\n \t<li>visual motor skills<\/li>\n \t<li>academics<\/li>\n \t<li>fine and gross motor<\/li>\n \t<li>etc.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n&#8230;but language and social skills are typically the most significant deficits for children with autism.\n\nThe failure to conduct appropriate assessment results in one of the biggest problems in programs that serve children with autism: An inappropriate curriculum.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5cfaa8 elementor-blockquote--skin-quotation elementor-blockquote--align-center elementor-blockquote--button-skin-link elementor-blockquote--button-view-icon-text elementor-widget elementor-widget-blockquote\" data-id=\"f5cfaa8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"blockquote.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"elementor-blockquote\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-blockquote__content\">\n\t\t\t\tThe failure to conduct appropriate assessment results in one of the biggest problems in programs that serve children with autism: An inappropriate curriculum.\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-q-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<cite class=\"elementor-blockquote__author\">Carl Sundberg, Ph.D., BCBA-D<\/cite>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/intent\/tweet?text=The+failure+to+conduct+appropriate+assessment+results+in+one+of+the+biggest+problems+in+programs+that+serve+children+with+autism%3A+An+inappropriate+curriculum.+%E2%80%94+Carl+Sundberg%2C+Ph.D.%2C+BCBA-D&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com%2Fresources%2Funlocking-the-vb-mapp-expert-tips-insights-video%2F\" class=\"elementor-blockquote__tweet-button\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fab fa-twitter\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-blockquote__tweet-label\">Share this<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19cc34b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"19cc34b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our first task is to identify the existing skills of each child. Our next task is to identify the barriers that are preventing more rapid learning:<\/p><ul><li>language<\/li><li>social<\/li><li>behavior<\/li><li>learning<\/li><\/ul><p>The VB-MAPP is a tool that is easy to use and will provide the necessary information to develop an appropriate intervention program to:<\/p><ul><li>teachers<\/li><li>parents<\/li><li>staff<\/li><\/ul><p>The VB-MAPP is an assessment tool based on <a href=\"https:\/\/psycnet.apa.org\/fulltext\/2014-51869-003.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">B.F. Skinner\u2019s (1957)<\/a> analysis of verbal behavior and typical developmental milestones.<\/p><p>This presentation will provide the attendee with an overview and an understanding of the importance of incorporating Skinner\u2019s analysis of verbal behavior into language assessment.<\/p><h2>What Will You Learn<\/h2><p><strong>After this presentation the participant will:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Understand the importance of conducting a comprehensive skill-based language assessment based on Skinner\u2019s (1957) analysis of verbal behavior.<\/li><li>Learn how to create a curriculum, based on the results of the language assessment. Using the VB-MAPP as a Basis for a Verbal Behavior Curriculum for Children With Autism.<\/li><li>Understand the need to identify and reduce barriers that are preventing more rapid learning for the student.<\/li><li>Understand the importance of creating a curriculum that is appropriate for the student\u2019s current repertoire.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":14998,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Unlocking The VB-MAPP: Expert Tips & Insights","_seopress_titles_desc":"View this webinar for an overview of the importance of incorporating Skinner\u2019s analysis of verbal behavior into language assessment.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[328,97,329,109,86],"resource-tag":[269,102,133,339,156],"class_list":["post-9186","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-assessment","resource-topic-autism","resource-topic-behavior","resource-topic-children","resource-topic-tips-tools-tech","resource-tag-communication","resource-tag-curriculum","resource-tag-parents","resource-tag-success","resource-tag-teacher"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9186","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9186\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/14998"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=9186"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"audience","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/audience?post=9186"},{"taxonomy":"resource-type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-type?post=9186"},{"taxonomy":"resource-topic","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-topic?post=9186"},{"taxonomy":"resource-tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-tag?post=9186"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}